{"v":4,"catch":"他跑著跑著。 作為一個生存的跑步者......","desc":"《METROCROSS》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1985年發行的動作遊戲。\n避開障礙物和滑區，充分利用滑板和跳板及時到達目標。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-08-18","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a686c7354e35f1c76d4dc11a9edd937eac16551f019ddfe8ea5e24361c30c994.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/133c0a9e8a3e80e23ed517a17dd84e8bfd806dfa19d28f920b3b0c245dbb08b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fde5150fb79a959afd5d1d2798fb45ff9fb5bce98a8cb84a9f5efce4ae4144c2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2d2d4f8e8da6d1981192b460ad4075a03df88cb8a681f3995aef5dda9bba976.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a6fb9c89000a6002f6b50fb1ad8098a0ea1da0a2948f969ccfee18e2d8d67532.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e43a145658ae6107882f55362e4aa59fc05d4f63a2585c46427f156c8bc24437.jpg"],"titleId":"01002ba0178f0000","dlc":[]}